# Added 2026-08-30. The repo had no .gitignore, so a local `npm install` leaves
# ~900 packages sitting untracked and one `git add -A` away from being committed.
node_modules/
/build
.env.local
.env.*.local
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored here, and also not tracked.
# Committing it would switch Vercel's install from `npm install` to `npm ci` and
# pin whatever tree the committing machine resolved that day — a change to the
# production build, not a housekeeping tidy, so it wants to be a decision rather
# than a side effect.
#
# Practical consequence: a local `npm install` generates it and leaves it showing
# as untracked. Delete it when you are done building, or commit it on purpose.
# Do not add it to this file to silence the noise — that would quietly rule out
# ever adopting a lockfile.
